Z||000003||Phil||01-31-2001||07:27 AM||||1/4 mile can be in the low to mid 13's MPG 28 to 30 highway(w 5sp) 0-60 5's. Smiles pricless||||reg||1
Z||000004||stimpy||01-31-2001||03:16 PM||||Mileage is pretty impressive with the automatic as well. My dad has a 3800 s/c. Only disappointing number is top speed.  Factory limited to 102 mph (engine is out of a Boneville). 0-60 like a bat outa hell!  Instant torque available at any speed. Gotta love it!||||reg||1
