Z||000012||terryk||02-01-2001||06:12 PM||||Phil, why would you want to change the VSS signal to the ECM? Oh, is it a flash PCM so you can avoid the limiter? I guess I'm wondering what you are trying to fix.<P>Would anyone be interested in running a Series II engine on a 94/95 ECM? A friend and I have been working on a calibration for a 94/95 (16183247?)ECM to run the Series II engine correctly. <P>I'd thought about patching in some stall saver code, but I might never get the time.<p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 02-01-2001).]||||reg||5
